# Current 12-Month Executive Coaching Program Overview

This current program overview describes the 12-month executive coaching offer for senior leaders and founders.

## Program structure
- **Duration:** 12 months.
- **Monthly cadence:** One 60-minute coaching session and one 30-minute practical application and training session.
- **Baseline assessments:** AQai Adaptability Assessment and Five-Mountain Leadership Assessment.
- **Optional asynchronous support:** Tuesday and Thursday support for €280 per month.
- **Additional individual sessions:** €450 per hour.
- **Core investment:** €5,400, payable in two installments of €2,700.

## Methodology
The coaching creates space to examine leadership priorities, communication, habits, and current work situations. Practical application is reviewed during the monthly rhythm.

